Z||000007||GPXSS||05-07-2001||03:13 PM||||just an FYI  the Grand Prix GTP came out in 1991 and had a 3.4litre DOHC engine. It carried that until 97 when Pontiac switched body styles and went with the supercharged 3800.  If this Fiero was in any way related to the GP GTP, it wouldve had the 3.4dohc motor.<P>-Chris<BR>||||reg||1
